OL,3,GNEWSAChief executive of failing health
OL,4,Aboard leaves for new job in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of Wales' largest and most
OL,7,Ftroubled health board is leaving her
OL,8,Fpost for one in England.
OL,10,FCarol Shillabeer became the chief
OL,11,Fexecutive of Betsi Cadwaladr University
OL,12,FHealth Board - which has spent nine
OL,13,Fyears in special measures - in May
OL,14,F2023.
OL,16,FThe health board covers all of north
OL,17,FWales, and has been under the highest
OL,18,Flevel of oversight due to concerns
OL,19,Fabout care quality, patient safety and
OL,20,Fleadership.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
