OL,3,GNEWSAChief executive of failing health
OL,4,Aboard leaves for new job in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FShillabeer will join Lancashire and
OL,7,FSouth Cumbria NHS Foundation Trust in
OL,8,Fnorth west England as their chief
OL,9,Fexecutive in the new year.
